close_reason: "pm package list lists the installed packages, and every package listing takes one --fields contract"
contract_change:
  api: "pm package list / pm packages list / pm extension list, pm package explore and manage rows, and the SDK StaticExtensionInventoryEntry/StaticExtensionInventoryResult types and ExtensionCommandOptions"
  before: pm package list was an alias of pm package catalog and returned the bundled catalog (details.packages); explore and manage rows embedded the full contributions map; inventory rows had no update column
  after: "pm package list is an alias of pm package inventory and returns the installed packages of the selected scope (extensions[] with an update column, plus updates_available); pm package catalog returns the bundled catalog; explore and manage rows leave contributions out unless --fields asks for it; list, explore, manage and catalog share one --fields contract"
  migrate: "Scripts that read the bundled catalog from pm package list switch to pm package catalog (same rows and --fields); readers of contributions in explore or manage rows pass --fields with contributions, or use pm package describe; SDK consumers that enumerate the keys of StaticExtensionInventoryEntry, StaticExtensionInventoryResult or ExtensionCommandOptions (Record<keyof ...> maps, exhaustive key lists, strict fixtures) add the optional update and updates_available keys and the optional scope option (project, local or global, selecting the same scope as the boolean switches): installed rows carry update, an absent row (a looked-up name that is not installed) omits it, and inspectStaticExtensionInventory always emits updates_available"
escape_class: production_defect
gate_evidence:
  disposition: gate_added
  owner: pm-gh1777
  gate_id: package-listing-installed-rows
  negative_control: "tests/unit/cli/static-extension-inventory.spec.ts runs pm package list and expects the installed inventory rows with the observed update column and the shared --fields refusal; on 2026.11.25 pm package list resolves to the bundled catalog (13 rows, installed=false, no installed packages) and --fields on inventory is refused as unknown_option; tests/unit/cli/canonical-command-recovery.spec.ts pins pm extensions list suggesting package list"
  local_checks[1]: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/cli/static-extension-inventory.spec.ts tests/unit/extensions/package-listing-observations.spec.ts tests/unit/cli/canonical-command-recovery.spec.ts
  hosted_checks[2]: Gates (coverage),Gates (static)
